WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.800
OP sequence

00:00:01.080 --> 00:00:10.860
Request from Ichigo... when watching the television, sit a safe distance from the television in a well-lit room.

00:00:07.650 --> 00:00:13.290
I do believe that both groups have the ability to advance,

00:00:12.040 --> 00:00:16.830
closed captions

00:00:13.290 --> 00:00:16.520
but according to the rules, we must decide on a winner.

00:00:17.060 --> 00:00:20.460
The rematch will be held on Monday, three days from now.

00:00:20.460 --> 00:00:22.360
It will be a team battle.

00:00:22.360 --> 00:00:24.740
The theme will be "friendship".

00:00:24.740 --> 00:00:29.970
Both of the teams have to make sweets that are appropriate for the theme of "friendship"...

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.560
Sorry, it's all my fault.

00:00:36.440 --> 00:00:40.150
Don't be too bothered by it. It's not that we lost.

00:00:40.150 --> 00:00:43.970
He's right, we just have to win the rematch.

00:00:43.970 --> 00:00:45.520
No problem!

00:00:45.520 --> 00:00:47.300
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:00:47.300 --> 00:00:50.210
Especially after you made such a basic mistake!

00:00:50.210 --> 00:00:52.200
If you hadn't lost...

00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:53.330
...we would have won!

00:00:53.330 --> 00:00:54.360
That's right!

00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.700
Right, right, right!

00:00:56.940 --> 00:00:59.080
My apologies...

00:00:59.780 --> 00:01:05.080
Anyway, you should get a hold of your feelings and find ideas about the theme for the rematch.

00:01:02.630 --> 00:01:05.080
Andou, you should do your best too.

00:01:05.510 --> 00:01:08.020
Team Ichigo, let's do our best!

00:01:08.020 --> 00:01:09.500
You're getting intensive training!

00:01:12.270 --> 00:01:13.760
Andou...

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:21.100
Woah, Team Koshiro completely thrashed their opponents in round 2.

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:23.960
Those rich girls are really amazing.

00:01:26.390 --> 00:01:29.650
I seem to have seen that girl before...

00:01:33.690 --> 00:01:35.300
Yes, it's Ichigo.

00:01:35.300 --> 00:01:37.820
What are you doing!? Get here this instant!

00:01:38.940 --> 00:01:39.830
You're late!

00:01:39.830 --> 00:01:41.950
Sorry, sorry.

00:01:41.950 --> 00:01:43.870
Huh? Where's Andou-kun?

00:01:44.380 --> 00:01:47.400
He's even later than Amano? I can't believe it.

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:48.380
There's big trouble!

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.260
Andou has... Andou has...

00:01:51.700 --> 00:01:53.850
He's gone missing!

00:01:57.320 --> 00:01:59.630
That guy left the school grounds!

00:02:00.210 --> 00:02:01.970
He was still here during dinner.

00:02:02.520 --> 00:02:05.480
He couldn't have gone too long ago.

00:02:05.970 --> 00:02:08.850
He left his luggage with the dorm superintendent before he left.

00:02:09.830 --> 00:02:11.490
The last bus for the night has gone already!

00:02:12.410 --> 00:02:14.490
Could he be going home?

00:02:14.980 --> 00:02:16.480
He must have.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:21.130
Andou-kun... could be thinking of quitting St. Marie...

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:22.430
Don't joke with me!

00:02:22.990 --> 00:02:25.690
I won't let him do that!

00:02:27.070 --> 00:02:28.190
Kashino...

00:02:28.840 --> 00:02:32.040
Anyways, tomorrow's the weekend.

00:02:32.040 --> 00:02:34.650
Let's hand in a notification of absence for Andou.

00:02:34.650 --> 00:02:36.130
Then, we'll bring him back.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.970
Andou...

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:53.180
fuwa fuwa funwari amakute toro kechau

00:02:46.910 --> 00:02:53.180
