00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:29.950
recipe 21

00:04:23.950 --> 00:04:29.950
Friendship Maccha Gâteau Chocolate

00:04:32.290 --> 00:04:33.900
Ichita-kun!

00:04:34.800 --> 00:04:37.800
Hey! If it isn't the Cake Pig, Narcissist, and Mapo Tofu...

00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:40.010
Didn't I say I'm not a pig!? Not a pig!

00:04:40.450 --> 00:04:42.160
Come on, now...

00:04:42.160 --> 00:04:44.340
Putting that aside, is your family's shop taking a break today?

00:04:44.340 --> 00:04:47.450
Grandpa and the rest have been at the onsen since yesterday.

00:04:47.450 --> 00:04:50.390
Only Mother, Chiho and Marie are at home now.

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:52.940
You didn't go along?

00:04:53.580 --> 00:04:55.980
An onsen isn't a place for young men.

00:04:56.670 --> 00:04:57.990
Alright... I see.

00:04:57.990 --> 00:04:58.700
What about Andou?

00:04:59.290 --> 00:05:03.220
About him... He did come back home very late yesterday night.

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:06.610
Thank goodness. He was here after all...

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.250
What happened to Sen-nii?

00:05:09.550 --> 00:05:10.830
To tell you the truth...

00:05:12.680 --> 00:05:15.610
Yumetsuki

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.320
He might be quitting sch-?

00:05:18.450 --> 00:05:23.630
All he said was that he came home to eat our sweets that he hasn't had in a while.

00:05:23.630 --> 00:05:26.960
What's with him! He's quitting after one loss?

00:05:26.960 --> 00:05:29.480
I've completely misjudged him!

00:05:30.350 --> 00:05:32.920
He didn't mention anything about quitting school..

00:05:32.920 --> 00:05:34.770
This means we still have hope.

00:05:34.770 --> 00:05:35.480
Of course!

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:40.450
Ichita-kun, do you know where Andou-kun might have gone to?

00:05:40.450 --> 00:05:42.020
Even if you ask...

00:05:43.360 --> 00:05:44.530
Perhaps he...

00:05:52.690 --> 00:05:54.300
So he really came here.

00:05:54.300 --> 00:05:55.680
As we expected.

00:05:55.680 --> 00:05:56.960
What's this place?

00:05:57.460 --> 00:06:00.470
When we were young, we always came here whenever we had problems.

00:06:00.470 --> 00:06:02.350
We talked about many things.

00:06:03.060 --> 00:06:05.260
We did it before the entrance exams of St. Marie too.

00:06:08.050 --> 00:06:10.670
But, if that's the case, we're in luck.

00:06:10.670 --> 00:06:12.060
Let's go and persuade him.

00:06:12.060 --> 00:06:12.770
Andou-

00:06:13.450 --> 00:06:16.200
Leave him to me.

00:06:16.200 --> 00:06:18.070
That might be the best way.

00:06:28.640 --> 00:06:30.210
Why did you run away?

00:06:34.560 --> 00:06:36.560
I'm just a weak person.

00:06:37.080 --> 00:06:40.010
Just hearing the established name Kujou scares me.

00:06:40.010 --> 00:06:43.090
I didn't get a wink of sleep the day before the match.

00:06:43.660 --> 00:06:47.010
So that's why you miscalculated the amount of the refined white sugar?

00:06:49.670 --> 00:06:53.020
As I thought, I'm different from you two.

00:06:53.020 --> 00:06:55.250
What is different?

00:06:58.250 --> 00:07:00.400
The reason I enrolled in St. Marie...

00:07:01.660 --> 00:07:04.320
...was because you advised me to.

00:07:06.440 --> 00:07:11.210
I continued the daily activities of the school because I always wanted to see your back.

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:20.040
Even though everyone calls me a Sweets Prince, among the three of us, I'm the one that has the least talent.

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:23.520
You were always the top in studies.

00:07:24.140 --> 00:07:28.010
Hanabusa also maintained his position in the top 5.

00:07:29.110 --> 00:07:32.050
I'm always limping behind in the top 10.

00:07:34.500 --> 00:07:35.510
I should be...

00:07:36.260 --> 00:07:37.220
Stop joking around with me!

00:07:37.220 --> 00:07:38.210
Kashino!

00:07:38.900 --> 00:07:40.380
Stop it!

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:43.350
Even if you fight, it won't solve anything!

00:07:43.350 --> 00:07:44.560
I object to violence!

00:07:56.010 --> 00:07:57.280
Do whatever you want!

00:07:59.400 --> 00:08:02.500
I don't want to see you being so miserable!

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.340
Andou-kun...

00:08:12.830 --> 00:08:18.230
When both Koshiro-san and I entered the pudding challenge and I got too ahead of myself after I won a match...

00:08:19.180 --> 00:08:21.330
The world of the Grand Prix is harsh.

00:08:21.870 --> 00:08:24.940
You're greatly mistaken if you think you can win with just efforts alone.

00:08:25.660 --> 00:08:28.040
That's what you told me.

00:08:28.040 --> 00:08:31.890
That I shouldn't run away just because I lost once.

00:08:31.890 --> 00:08:33.450
Let's do our best.

00:08:33.910 --> 00:08:35.610
Ichigo's right.

00:08:36.210 --> 00:08:42.430
Compared to the useless Ichigo who still continues to taste her defeats, yours is nothing.

00:08:42.430 --> 00:08:45.620
Vanilla, that's too much.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:48.310
In my opinion...

00:08:48.310 --> 00:08:51.170
...you didn't lose in terms of talent.

00:08:51.170 --> 00:08:54.760
You lost sight of yourself because of the Kujou brand.

00:08:57.240 --> 00:09:00.810
Without you, Team Ichigo won't be complete.

00:09:00.810 --> 00:09:02.650
I have the same thoughts too.

00:09:02.650 --> 00:09:07.020
When he wanted to give up after he couldn't make a good Rose Pound Cake...

00:09:08.030 --> 00:09:09.390
You really are stupid...

00:09:09.390 --> 00:09:11.660
You don't have to do so much...

00:09:11.660 --> 00:09:13.620
I have to because we are friends.

00:09:14.170 --> 00:09:16.290
You are not alone, you know?

00:09:16.290 --> 00:09:17.080
That's right.

00:09:17.080 --> 00:09:19.430
We can help you and also discuss with you. 

00:09:19.430 --> 00:09:21.370
That's why you don't have to bottle up your feelings.

00:09:22.480 --> 00:09:24.470
That really encouraged him.

00:09:24.470 --> 00:09:28.810
When Kashino and Hanabusa, whom have the exact opposite personalities, were arguing...

00:09:28.810 --> 00:09:31.340
...it's always you who stopped their argument.

00:09:31.880 --> 00:09:34.940
To Team Ichigo, you're...

00:09:34.940 --> 00:09:38.610
Using a paper fan as an example, you would be the pivot.

00:09:38.610 --> 00:09:40.810
Then, how about Kashino and Hanabusa?

00:09:40.810 --> 00:09:42.810
Let me see...

00:09:42.810 --> 00:09:45.290
Kashino would be the frame...

00:09:45.290 --> 00:09:49.800
and I would be the fan paper painted with vivid paintings.

00:09:49.800 --> 00:09:51.740
Aren't you just saying that you're the main character!?

00:09:51.740 --> 00:09:52.570
That's right!

00:09:52.570 --> 00:09:55.030
Then, then..! What about me?

00:09:58.030 --> 00:10:00.820
Between the paper and the frame...

00:10:00.820 --> 00:10:01.750
You're the glue?

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:03.950
Glue!?

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.810
Andou-kun laughed.

00:10:08.810 --> 00:10:10.390
Did I make you worry?

00:10:10.390 --> 00:10:12.180
Andou...

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:17.270
What's that?

00:10:17.750 --> 00:10:18.990
Just eat it.

00:10:28.370 --> 00:10:29.370
Delicious...

00:10:30.070 --> 00:10:31.470
Who made this?

00:10:31.470 --> 00:10:33.330
Ichita is the one who made them.

00:10:33.330 --> 00:10:34.540
Ichita!

00:10:34.540 --> 00:10:35.580
You've improved!

00:10:39.160 --> 00:10:41.100
Then, this one is...

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:46.440
Terrible...

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:47.790
Eh? Is it that bad?

00:10:47.790 --> 00:10:49.040
Let me taste a bit.

00:10:49.040 --> 00:10:50.080
Me too.

00:10:50.890 --> 00:10:53.170
It's not sweet at all and the red beans are so dry!

00:10:55.240 --> 00:10:58.060
How is it possible to make it taste so bad?

00:10:58.060 --> 00:11:01.180
Y-You guys really criticised the daifuku that I made....

00:11:01.820 --> 00:11:05.540
Even for me. If it's not my specialty, it'll end up like that.

00:11:05.540 --> 00:11:07.100
Do you understand that, Andou?

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:10.030
Thanks, Kashino.

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:14.010
I feel a lot better, thanks to everyone.

00:11:14.010 --> 00:11:17.400
I'll never say that I want to quit school again.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.660
I-Is that so?

00:11:37.110 --> 00:11:38.130
Oh my, the senpais.

00:11:38.820 --> 00:11:40.950
Have you all came back?

00:11:40.950 --> 00:11:43.870
I heard all of you handed up notifications of absence.

00:11:43.870 --> 00:11:47.150
I thought you must have turned your backs and run away.

00:11:48.770 --> 00:11:50.360
Sorry to say you're wrong.

00:11:51.020 --> 00:11:55.190
To make our friendship sweets, we went to deepen our friendship.

00:11:57.530 --> 00:12:00.040
I forgot to tell you.

00:12:00.040 --> 00:12:05.240
At the Paris campus, I'm Henri Lucas-sensei's favourite student.

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:10.580
My transfer to Japan is also because Henri-sensei advised me:

00:12:10.580 --> 00:12:13.990
"If you're able to grasp the skills of making Japanese confectioneries...

00:12:13.990 --> 00:12:15.940
...you'll be able to make even more wonderful sweets."

00:12:15.940 --> 00:12:17.370
What about that?

00:12:18.790 --> 00:12:22.380
It isn't Henri-sensei making the friendship sweets.

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:23.930
It's both you and I.

00:12:24.600 --> 00:12:29.390
The present us are able to make friendship sweets that won't lose to anyone else.

00:12:29.940 --> 00:12:35.190
I'm so excited to see what incredible friendship sweets we'll be able to make.

00:12:35.190 --> 00:12:36.460
Yeah, yeah!

00:12:36.460 --> 00:12:38.550
Let's get straight to our special training!

00:12:38.550 --> 00:12:39.820
Alright!

00:12:40.850 --> 00:12:41.630
Hey.

00:12:42.890 --> 00:12:45.450
Is there any friendship in your team?

00:12:47.470 --> 00:12:51.490
As friends, have you all opened up your hearts to one another?

00:12:59.680 --> 00:13:04.920
And now, we will now begin the rematch for the quarterfinals between Team Ichigo and Team Lemon.

00:13:05.690 --> 00:13:07.220
Everyone to your stations.

00:13:07.790 --> 00:13:10.140
I wonder if Ichigo-chan and the others will be fine?

00:13:10.140 --> 00:13:11.480
Don't worry.

00:13:11.480 --> 00:13:13.610
Andou-kun has revived.

00:13:13.610 --> 00:13:14.700
Commence cooking.

00:13:17.670 --> 00:13:20.660
We mustn't lose to Team Ichigo.

00:13:25.140 --> 00:13:27.700
Morino-kun, your hands have stopped moving!

00:13:27.700 --> 00:13:28.590
Sorry.

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:31.370
I was distracted by your skillfulness of cutting the skin...

00:13:32.100 --> 00:13:33.380
Geez...

00:13:32.530 --> 00:13:34.380
That shop's Chiffon is really tasty...

00:13:34.960 --> 00:13:36.080
You're right.

00:13:36.080 --> 00:13:38.960
Hey, you all. Concentrate on your work!

00:13:41.470 --> 00:13:43.260
Alright... Now to bake!

00:13:43.920 --> 00:13:46.270
Amano, if you've finished your part, go help out the others.

00:13:46.880 --> 00:13:47.800
Roger!

00:13:48.320 --> 00:13:51.100
Then, I shall grind the maccha. I leave this to you.

00:13:55.860 --> 00:14:00.020
It's smells so rich and fragrant that I won't even believe maccha has that kind of a sweetness.

00:14:00.700 --> 00:14:06.780
It's a special blend that Andou's grandfather ordered from the venerable Uji tea shop.

00:14:07.300 --> 00:14:09.600
Andou is really getting into it.

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:12.440
Of course, he wants to deliver his revenge!

00:14:25.810 --> 00:14:28.120
Team Lemon has finished.

00:14:28.120 --> 00:14:30.050
We have also finished!

00:14:30.710 --> 00:14:31.500
Chances of winning?

00:14:31.530 --> 00:14:32.260
I have full confidence.

00:14:33.370 --> 00:14:35.270
What's with their overly calm attitude?

00:14:36.200 --> 00:14:39.860
Oh, is it chocolate and lemon roll cakes?

00:14:40.450 --> 00:14:41.300
Yes.

00:14:41.920 --> 00:14:48.490
If you eat both of them alternately, you will be able to taste the depth of our team's friendship.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.950
Well then, shall I tuck in?

00:15:00.390 --> 00:15:01.890
Impressive.

00:15:02.940 --> 00:15:04.170
Alright!

00:15:04.170 --> 00:15:09.910
The sourness of the lemon and the bitterness of the chocolate is matched perfectly.

00:15:09.910 --> 00:15:15.270
Especially, the lemon flavour from the lemon peel has provided a moderate accent.

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:18.960
This is our creation.

00:15:30.250 --> 00:15:31.800
Magical macaron.

00:15:31.800 --> 00:15:33.740
Sweets Romance Card.

00:15:33.740 --> 00:15:35.260
Come out!

00:15:37.840 --> 00:15:40.080
It's a Japanese style maccha gâteau chocolat.

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:44.460
Is there any significance to the four elegant yellow warbler-like candies?

00:15:45.210 --> 00:15:51.620
The one at the bottom is Andou who fell down after his loss in the last individual battle.

00:15:51.620 --> 00:15:53.630
The three at the top are encouraging him.

00:15:53.630 --> 00:15:54.660
You're wrong.

00:15:55.460 --> 00:15:57.810
The bottom one isn't Andou but you.

00:15:59.100 --> 00:16:00.520
Why me!?

00:16:12.910 --> 00:16:15.790
I feel it's a little too sweet...

00:16:16.380 --> 00:16:17.600
It's true.

00:16:17.600 --> 00:16:23.930
In a typical maccha chocolate, the maccha would be bitter while the white chocolate would be sweet...

00:16:23.930 --> 00:16:26.820
Yet, in this, the maccha doesn't have a bit of bitterness.

00:16:26.820 --> 00:16:28.410
And the chocolate tastes weakly.

00:16:30.200 --> 00:16:32.220
No, please wait...

00:16:33.910 --> 00:16:38.180
Don't you feel the flavor deepens after every bite?

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:43.680
The sourness of the strawberry jam and the candies creates a particular sweetness,

00:16:43.680 --> 00:16:47.150
matching perfectly with the not-so-sweet white chocolate.

00:16:47.150 --> 00:16:51.480
How can I put it... It creates a sense of harmony.

00:16:51.480 --> 00:16:54.200
I can feel a richness that can't be judged in a normal way.

00:16:56.140 --> 00:17:00.090
By the way, about the significance of the elegant yellow warbler-like candies...

00:17:00.090 --> 00:17:05.660
I would say it's the kindness of the three cheering up and consoling their friend.

00:17:05.660 --> 00:17:10.190
The one bird separated from the others, meeting up with his friends, to face off the opponent.

00:17:10.190 --> 00:17:14.430
Or it could be distancing himself from his friends on purpose, taking into consideration the situation at hand.

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:22.810
Right. Don't they share a kindness that, similar to this cake, can't be judged in a normal way?

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:26.350
This is what I believe.

00:17:28.170 --> 00:17:29.960
I could be thinking too much.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:34.680
I'm getting the feeling that the situation doesn't look good.

00:17:34.680 --> 00:17:37.680
If you lose, then you won't be able to return to Paris.

00:17:37.680 --> 00:17:43.100
I teamed up with you because I heard that Henri-sensei favours you.

00:17:44.180 --> 00:17:45.990
I feel I've wasted my efforts!

00:17:46.670 --> 00:17:50.920
There isn't much of a big difference between the two teams.

00:17:51.450 --> 00:17:54.850
But considering the theme of friendship,

00:17:54.850 --> 00:17:58.010
the winner has already been decided, hasn't it?

00:18:03.250 --> 00:18:04.430
They did it!

00:18:04.430 --> 00:18:05.720
Yay~

00:18:05.720 --> 00:18:07.020
Wee~

00:18:07.490 --> 00:18:08.680
Alright!

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:11.030
What are you going to do with this?

00:18:11.030 --> 00:18:13.610
Our team is dissolved.

00:18:17.580 --> 00:18:18.390
Lemon-chan!

00:18:25.240 --> 00:18:26.800
Lemon-chan...

00:18:26.800 --> 00:18:28.460
Can I have a moment?

00:18:29.340 --> 00:18:32.380
I object if it's about friendship.

00:18:32.380 --> 00:18:34.480
I only came to talk to you.

00:18:36.390 --> 00:18:41.420
I too came to this school because I received Henri-sensei's recommendation.

00:18:42.810 --> 00:18:46.100
But all I got was failures and setbacks.

00:18:46.730 --> 00:18:48.700
There were many times when I wanted to quit.

00:18:49.730 --> 00:18:54.870
It's all thanks to the Sweets Princes that I've made it this far in the Grand Prix.

00:18:58.540 --> 00:19:04.200
During the confrontation of the fruits jelly, I purposely suggested we use kiwis to make you lose.

00:19:04.200 --> 00:19:07.540
You're really too kind, senpai.

00:19:07.540 --> 00:19:10.510
About that, I can only blame myself for not knowing the basics.

00:19:19.100 --> 00:19:25.160
Though I said that I came to Japan because Henri-sensei recommended me to...

00:19:26.010 --> 00:19:26.980
That was a lie.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:34.610
The truth is that when I boasted that I got the highest grades in Paris campus,

00:19:34.610 --> 00:19:36.320
Henri-sensei reprimanded me.

00:19:37.100 --> 00:19:42.330
I will admit your talents but you're too pre-occupied about yourself.

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:47.460
If you aim to be a top-class pâtissière, you must be able to learn from anyone.

00:19:47.460 --> 00:19:49.890
You must absorb it all, no matter how small...

00:19:49.890 --> 00:19:52.210
If not, you won't be able to grow.

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:54.840
Like Amano Ichigo at the Japan campus.

00:19:55.420 --> 00:20:00.950
I really wanted to understand the meaning of his words, so I transferred here.

00:20:01.500 --> 00:20:05.270
I wanted to ascertain if you were as great as Henri-sensei had described you.

00:20:05.270 --> 00:20:09.490
No way... Henri-sensei's made too much of me...

00:20:10.500 --> 00:20:13.380
I have checked about you secretly...

00:20:13.380 --> 00:20:16.850
...and now that we've met, I feel that Henri-sensei was right.

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.940
Lemon-chan...

00:20:21.220 --> 00:20:24.200
I will return to Paris.

00:20:24.200 --> 00:20:26.750
It's not because I lost the match.

00:20:27.910 --> 00:20:30.010
I want to be able to be honest to myself, like you.

00:20:30.010 --> 00:20:33.840
And start all over again learning from Henri-sensei.

00:20:33.840 --> 00:20:35.650
That's really great.

00:20:35.650 --> 00:20:38.580
Rather than great, I really envy you.

00:20:39.600 --> 00:20:41.200
Senpai.

00:20:41.200 --> 00:20:44.220
I won't lose to you next time, okay?

00:20:45.240 --> 00:20:46.900
Thank you very much.

00:20:56.010 --> 00:20:58.380
Lemon-chan is a good girl, isn't she?

00:20:58.380 --> 00:20:59.340
Yeah.

00:21:00.680 --> 00:21:02.080
Huh?

00:21:05.430 --> 00:21:06.900
Sweets Spirits!?

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.830
It looks like someone got interested in Lemon-chan going back to the basics.

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:19.830
Looks like it.

